mysqldump --all-tablespaces wrote tablespace, logfile group and engine
names unescaped, a malicious server could inject SQL or client commands
into the dump (Bug#36816986, Bug#37607195). PLD addition: a name longer
than the comment buffer from a malicious server no longer overflows it.
https://github.com/percona/percona-server/commit/764a43f9ed
https://github.com/percona/percona-server/commit/be5cb90bf0

